{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aim for the heart of the dungeon!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/03b2f38266af9ef014e27ebd10841687.poster.avif?t=1757039039\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/03b2f38266af9ef014e27ebd10841687.webm?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/03b2f38266af9ef014e27ebd10841687.mp4?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore a dungeon that changes with every playthrough, defeat the Black Witch who awaits you in its depths, and free your friends from their jewel prisons!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather Jewels!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/3e682edfa72a7c104c271537fce5397a.poster.avif?t=1757039039\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/3e682edfa72a7c104c271537fce5397a.webm?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/3e682edfa72a7c104c271537fce5397a.mp4?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Collect the jewels (i.e., units) located throughout the dungeon and add them to your party. Acquire duplicates of the same jewel to upgrade their stats!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your own unique order of knights!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/d58a06c0f9222283c4c47bd61a66b895.poster.avif?t=1757039039\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/d58a06c0f9222283c4c47bd61a66b895.webm?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/d58a06c0f9222283c4c47bd61a66b895.mp4?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Adding jewels to your party activates powerful symbol abilities. Mix and match the colors and symbols of the jewels you encounter to activate a variety of effects and build your own unique team!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use gems to support your party!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/1b73997458e9a2e2893f5962a0368d80.poster.avif?t=1757039039\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/1b73997458e9a2e2893f5962a0368d80.webm?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/1b73997458e9a2e2893f5962a0368d80.mp4?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Players can utilize magical powers and tools hidden in jewels to support their party in battle.<br>Make strategic use of your gems to defeat the enemies you encounter throughout the dungeon!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessories galore</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/ac592c4ffacc028f746e3e28596c9453.poster.avif?t=1757039039\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/ac592c4ffacc028f746e3e28596c9453.webm?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1569090/extras/ac592c4ffacc028f746e3e28596c9453.mp4?t=1757039039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A range of accessories can be found in the dungeon.<br>Accessories bestow a variety of effects when equipped, giving your team an extra boost.<br>Choose the right accessories for your party, and you just might stand a chance against the Black Witch!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Foray","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/81e399979f15432be83f449b3a800a76b25c9b0b.jpg"},{"name":"Turf War","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/3d940292da3771f3fefe0e5e6069ed6eeab81243.jpg"},{"name":"Guardian of Starlight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/97eeac313672e772db47df71cd42ada807087f5b.jpg"},{"name":"All Creation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/fb2ce581e4a43bf6bb568aacf2f44a7ad8f37da7.jpg"},{"name":"Goddess of Liberation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/703662b3a35597c1c5ee4d90a4d535bc7297d16f.jpg"},{"name":"Sisterhood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/f06a0927f3b730ea7e9b8023ef66715867d588d7.jpg"},{"name":"As You Are","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/8eb9977a7fc3c2b5e65852f00d4a3955d5948871.jpg"},{"name":"Sleepless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/3b73aa3e53c6487a89e20d927a687fd5ff74c8d9.jpg"},{"name":"Pacificist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/8f3b7ee6a98d3685d3c559a8647b6b68d69dc7b8.jpg"},{"name":"Calm and Collected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1569090/e257fa7b7ac0385113075cfdc9182c5a07dc92a2.jpg"}],"total":62},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com